---
---

<section class="apple-planner-section" id="planejador" aria-labelledby="planner-heading">
  <div class="apple-container">
    <div class="apple-section-header">
      <p class="apple-eyebrow-accent">ROTA PONTO A PONTO</p>
      <h2 id="planner-heading" class="apple-section-headline">
        Planeje qualquer trajeto.<br/>
        <span class="apple-headline-gradient">Menos passos, zero complicação.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="apple-section-subhead">
        Digite sua origem e seu destino em Manaus. O Manô calcula a caminhada a pé exata, indica o ponto de embarque ideal e a melhor conexão entre linhas.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Apple Interactive Planner Showcase Stage -->
    <div class="planner-showcase-stage">
      <!-- Left: Interactive Route Stepper Card -->
      <div class="planner-card-stack">
        <div class="planner-step-item">
          <div class="step-node-col">
            <span class="node-dot dot-origin"></span>
            <span class="node-connector"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <span class="step-label">ORIGEM</span>
            <strong class="step-title">Rua Kobe — Parque 10 de Novembro</strong>
            <p class="step-detail">Caminhada a pé: 240 m (3 minutos até o ponto)</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="planner-step-item">
          <div class="step-node-col">
            <span class="node-dot dot-bus"></span>
            <span class="node-connector"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <div class="step-tag-row">
              <span class="step-label">EMBARQUE</span>
              <span class="bus-chip">Linha 640 Expresso</span>
              <span class="bus-eta-chip">Em 3 min</span>
            </div>
            <strong class="step-title">Estação E2 — Arena da Amazônia</strong>
            <p class="step-detail">Corredor Constantino Nery expresso sem paradas laterais</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="planner-step-item">
          <div class="step-node-col">
            <span class="node-dot dot-destination"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <span class="step-label">DESTINO</span>
            <strong class="step-title">Terminal 1 (T1) — Centro Histórico</strong>
            <p class="step-detail">Duração total estimada: 18 min • Integração gratuita</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="planner-summary-footer">
          <div class="summary-metric">
            <span class="metric-num">18 min</span>
            <span class="metric-caption">Tempo total de porta a porta</span>
          </div>
          <div class="summary-metric">
            <span class="metric-num">240 m</span>
            <span class="metric-caption">Menor percurso a pé</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Front View Display of Trip Planner UI -->
      <div class="planner-screen-preview" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="planner-device-chassis">
          <div class="planner-device-rim"></div>
          <div class="planner-device-island"></div>
          <img
            src="/screens/planner.webp"
            width="768"
            height="1670"
            alt="Interface do Planejador de Viagens do Manô"
            class="planner-screen-img"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
